{cmd:7F0905006B}{cmd:7F09000010}{cmd:7F031E}.{cmd:7F0308}.{cmd:7F0308}.{cmd:7F030C}
I can't believe{cmd:7F0306} you
couldn't even do something
this simple,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000015}Oh, that thing,{cmd:7F0306} right?{cmd:7F030C}
You came to pick up
{cmd:7F26},
didn't you?{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}Well,{cmd:7F0306} it's not here now.{cmd:7F030A}
{cmd:7F25} came
and took it away.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Why?{cmd:7F0304} How should I know?{cmd:7F030C}
Go see {cmd:7F25}
and{cmd:7F0308} ask about it
yourself.{cmd:7F0308} OK?
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}From the {cmd:7F504BA0000B}post office,{cmd:7F0306}
you can send letters{cmd:7F0306}
to people in town,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}You should send me
a letter, too!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}If it's interesting,{cmd:7F0304}
I'll write you back,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000004}{cmd:7F0305}Oh, right!{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F090000FF}
You can send presents
with your letters, too!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Grab the item you want
to send with the letter{cmd:7F0304}
on your {cmd:7F50E11ED70B}item screen.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Then move it over
to the letter and
press the {cmd:7F50324BE108}A Button.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}There you go!{cmd:7F0306}
You've attached a
present to your letter!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000015}
{cmd:7F02}Sometimes I send{cmd:7F0306}
presents with my
letters, too, so look
forward to it!{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}By the {cmd:7F504BA0000B}post office is the
{cmd:7F50E11ED70B}town melody {cmd:7F504BA0000E}bulletin board.{cmd:7F0305}
{cmd:7F0900000B}{cmd:7F0305}Have you seen it?{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}The music written there?{cmd:7F0308}
Anybody{cmd:7F0304} can change it{cmd:7F0306}
whenever they want!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}It's used for the chimes.{cmd:7F0306}
It's the original song
of {cmd:7F2F},{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}And,{cmd:7F030C} there's a
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F504BA0000E}bulletin board by
your house, too,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Anybody can{cmd:7F0306} read
or write messages there,{cmd:7F0304}
no matter where
they're from!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Maybe I'll write{cmd:7F0306}
"Looking for friends!"
or{cmd:7F0304} something like that!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000007}What if cute boys{cmd:7F0304}
start lining up
to be my friend?!{cmd:7F09000014}{cmd:7F0308}
Oh, my gosh!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}You know,{cmd:7F0304} I don't plan
to stay in the same town
forever,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}If I could,{cmd:7F0306} I'd like to
live in all sorts{cmd:7F0304}
of places,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000017}The trouble is,{cmd:7F0304} I can't{cmd:7F0304}
move to another town
all by myself,{cmd:7F0306}
{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}If you{cmd:7F0304} took a trip
out of town,{cmd:7F0308}
I could come with you{cmd:7F0304}
and move there.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000007}So,{cmd:7F0304} pretty please,{cmd:7F0306}
go visit another town!{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000001}{cmd:7F0308}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F09000016}{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F090000FF}Sigh.
At a time like this,
take a deep breath.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Come to think of it,{cmd:7F0308}
some people reject
everything they
don't understand{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F0304}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Well, anyway,{cmd:7F0306}
I'll give you this outfit.{cmd:7F0308}
It's one of my favorites,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.{cmd:7F0C030001}{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F090000FF}Experiencing fine things
will enrich your life,{cmd:7F030C}
{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

Sometimes the rain stops
without you noticing.{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F09000007}
{cmd:7F02}Then you realize{cmd:7F0304}
you're the only one
with an open umbrella.{cmd:7F0306}
That's happened, right?{cmd:7F09000017}{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}It's so embarrassing!{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F090000FF}
But once you notice,{cmd:7F0306}
closing it in a hurry
feels embarrassing, too.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}So don't you just
keep{cmd:7F0900000B} walking like that
for a little while?{cmd:7F1600DC00ED}{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F0D}{cmd:7F0F29A8}{cmd:7F1029A9}{cmd:7F19}
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F09000004}Oh!{cmd:7F030C} {cmd:7F26}!{cmd:7F0304}
You brought it for me!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1A}!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}But this is a surprise!{cmd:7F030F}
How did you know
where to find me?!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}?!
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F09000006}Oh, yeah!{cmd:7F030C}
You probably know,{cmd:7F0306}
but I'm getting ready
to move!{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}The town you visit
will be the town
I move to,{cmd:7F0306} so
think{cmd:7F0304} carefully!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000012}Otherwise,{cmd:7F0306} I'll come
straight back to
{cmd:7F2F}!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000010}Oh,{cmd:7F0308} no!{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000016}You{cmd:7F0308} can't possibly
carry anything more!{cmd:7F030C}
It's absolutely hopeless!
No way,{cmd:7F0306} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F0900000A}I was,{cmd:7F0306}
like, really touched!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Whatever the letter said,{cmd:7F0306}
coming to {cmd:7F2F}
to send it was
what made me happy!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}One little thing can
change your impression
of someone,{cmd:7F0306}
so take a lesson from that!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000015}Happy New Year!{cmd:7F0310}
Let's have another
great year together!
{cmd:7F5832}

{cmd:7F0C050003}{cmd:7F09000015}Heh heh{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}.{cmd:7F0306}
Well, let me explain
the rules of the game,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}Try to guess{cmd:7F0306}
my favorite color!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}But,{cmd:7F0308} it changes with
my mood,{cmd:7F0306} so it won't
be that easy,
{cmd:7F0306}{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000B}{cmd:7F0303}Are you ready?
{cmd:7F160044003D}{cmd:7F04}{cmd:7F0D}{cmd:7F0F213C}{cmd:7F10213D}{cmd:7F19}
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F09000016}You,{cmd:7F0306} as usual,
have no sense of time!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}I know you can't wait
to see me,{cmd:7F0306} but
it's {cmd:7F21} {cmd:7F76}!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Really,{cmd:7F0306} didn't you think
I'd be asleep by now?!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F01}

{cmd:7F09000017}In the town where
I used to live,{cmd:7F0306}
the train never
arrived on time.
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0C090002}It was usually about
{cmd:7F32} minutes late,{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000015}Every town has
good and bad points,{cmd:7F0306}
but I think {cmd:7F2F}
is a nice place,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000015}Despite appearances,
that's one fun person!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Looks can give you
the wrong impression,{cmd:7F0306}
but having a chat
is really quite fun!
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000E}You should go say
hello now and then!{cmd:7F0308}
{cmd:7F1C}!
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F09000016}That's a pretty
nasty personality.
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F09000017}I don't really like
to talk behind
people's backs,{cmd:7F0306}
but it does bother me.
{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}{cmd:7F0900000F}Anyway, be careful
not to fall for
all that sweet talk,{cmd:7F0304}
{cmd:7F0308}{cmd:7F1C}.
{cmd:7F00}

{cmd:7F090000FF}Planting flowers
this time of year{cmd:7F0304}
{cmd:7F09000017}is no use,{cmd:7F0308} {cmd:7F1A}.{cmd:7F04}
{cmd:7F02}Even if you plant them,{cmd:7F0308}
they just wilt
straight away.
{cmd:7F00}
